WEBVTT

01:24.721 --> 01:29.041
LAZARUS

01:39.863 --> 01:41.585
Everyone, look at this.

01:42.541 --> 01:43.744
What's this?

01:44.048 --> 01:45.489
Paper magazines in this era?

01:45.786 --> 01:49.265
This is a spiritual magazine
from 15 years ago.

01:49.633 --> 01:53.162
A researcher from MIT
visiting a communion.

01:53.755 --> 01:55.479
Wow, that's cool.

01:55.661 --> 01:56.606
This is Skinner.

01:56.773 --> 01:57.856
Wow!

01:57.895 --> 01:59.118
When I was young.

01:59.235 --> 02:00.671
Are you serious?

02:00.787 --> 02:05.399
A relentless young researcher
make achievements,

02:05.774 --> 02:09.550
Professor Skinner visited this communion
and was amazed by their idealism.

02:09.707 --> 02:10.377
That's what it says.

02:10.955 --> 02:13.447
Could this magazine be a clue?

02:13.676 --> 02:18.129
In essence, communion still exists today.
in the form of a new religion.

02:18.853 --> 02:21.192
Its name is the Tower of Truth.

02:23.310 --> 02:24.887
Oh, no.

02:25.539 --> 02:28.447
They worship imitation reason
who has reached singularity...

02:28.472 --> 02:32.432
...and become a transcending being
man as God.

02:32.861 --> 02:35.547
Imitation mind that has no ego...

02:35.605 --> 02:38.282
...and their wishes are deemed appropriate
to become God in the modern era.

02:38.504 --> 02:39.588
What?

02:39.613 --> 02:41.685
Seems suspicious.

02:42.334 --> 02:46.010
They live life to the fullest
isolated from the outside world.

02:47.038 --> 02:49.296
Isn't it a perfect place...

02:49.474 --> 02:51.431
...if Skinner wants to hide himself?

02:51.615 --> 02:54.141
We've covered this topic before.

02:54.242 --> 02:56.218
I bet 15
if Skinner wasn't there.

02:56.315 --> 02:58.005
I bet 20
if he was there.

02:58.030 --> 02:59.336
Hey, you two.

02:59.360 --> 03:00.176
Elaine.

03:00.269 --> 03:02.156
Can you access?
imitation reason?

03:02.473 --> 03:03.643
Impossible.

03:03.997 --> 03:07.457
Dragon completely disconnected
from the outside world.

03:07.725 --> 03:08.595
Dragon?

03:09.750 --> 03:11.346
That's the name of their imitation mind.

03:11.666 --> 03:13.840
Huh? How do you know?

03:15.113 --> 03:18.332
I grew up there.

03:19.036 --> 03:19.841
Huh?

03:22.840 --> 03:25.736
If they can't
contacted from outside,

03:25.839 --> 03:27.655
we have to infiltrate.

03:27.863 --> 03:31.545
If I pretend
want to return to communion...

03:31.602 --> 03:33.069
...they should have welcomed me
With pleasure.

03:33.130 --> 03:33.955
You are alone?

03:33.980 --> 03:35.432
Should not.
It's too dangerous.

03:35.924 --> 03:37.190
At least, there should be someone to accompany you.

03:37.433 --> 03:39.575
Adults would definitely be suspected.

03:40.053 --> 03:41.683
But, if the children...

03:43.950 --> 03:44.700
Huh?

03:46.120 --> 03:50.620
#06: HEAVEN IS A PLACE ON EARTH

04:20.351 --> 04:22.979
We will be on standby
at a hostel near here.

04:23.555 --> 04:26.652
If you find Skinner,
contact us immediately.

04:27.120 --> 04:29.990
If there is no news from you guys
within 72 hours,

04:30.290 --> 04:31.476
we will do the rescue.

04:31.578 --> 04:33.597
Oh yeah, bring this.

04:34.443 --> 04:35.393
What's this?

04:35.516 --> 04:37.026
Flare.

04:37.576 --> 04:38.984
It might be useful.

04:39.238 --> 04:42.004
Another reckless method, huh.

04:42.310 --> 04:43.221
Leland.

04:44.100 --> 04:45.364
Please take care of Eleina.

04:46.001 --> 04:48.171
That is for sure.

04:50.470 --> 04:55.940
TOWER OF TRUTH

05:19.820 --> 05:20.780
Elaine?

05:21.944 --> 05:22.864
Is this true?

05:23.427 --> 05:24.887
Are you really Eleina?

05:25.714 --> 05:26.690
Hannah.

05:26.981 --> 05:28.781
Elaine!

05:29.462 --> 05:32.962
I am very happy
because you came home here!

05:33.533 --> 05:34.998
That...

05:35.451 --> 05:36.991
Please introduce him.

05:37.796 --> 05:39.111
This is Lyon.

05:39.160 --> 05:40.442
He is my new friend.

05:40.722 --> 05:41.772
Hello.

05:41.941 --> 05:43.417
She's Hannah.

05:43.541 --> 05:46.518
He was my friend while I was here.

05:46.943 --> 05:48.390
Nice to meet you, Lyon.

06:04.689 --> 06:05.769
Carla.

06:06.355 --> 06:07.405
Elaine?

06:08.518 --> 06:10.659
I thought so, Eleina.

06:10.985 --> 06:12.871
I am home.

06:13.305 --> 06:15.823
I knew you would come back someday.

06:16.877 --> 06:18.207
You already know, right?

06:18.519 --> 06:20.847
How dirty the world is out there.

06:21.313 --> 06:23.034
Wow, wow.

06:23.417 --> 06:25.207
Welcome, my family.

06:25.827 --> 06:28.407
Eleina, I'm glad you're back.

06:29.045 --> 06:32.005
We welcome you,
oh new family member.

06:32.886 --> 06:34.386
I'm Billy.

06:34.739 --> 06:36.127
I am the representative of this place.

06:36.207 --> 06:37.700
Oh, yes.

06:38.194 --> 06:41.050
You happen to be home
before the festival is held.

06:41.204 --> 06:44.008
This must be guidance from the Dragon Lord.

06:50.536 --> 06:54.084
What are mobile phones and stuff
only this one is connected to the internet?

06:54.131 --> 06:55.171
Yes

06:55.510 --> 06:56.406
Eleina is the same?

06:56.547 --> 06:57.507
Yes

06:58.372 --> 07:01.356
The outside world is filled with
false information...

07:01.730 --> 07:04.237
...and humans often
misled by it.

07:04.867 --> 07:06.053
Stay cool.

07:06.101 --> 07:09.021
Lord Dragon protects
all his followers.

07:09.421 --> 07:10.557
That's how it is.

07:10.610 --> 07:13.370
Hopefully the outside world brainwashes
can be lost soon.

07:15.731 --> 07:17.771
Brainwash?

07:43.784 --> 07:44.940
It's useless.

07:45.033 --> 07:45.920
Leland?

07:46.115 --> 07:47.881
Oh, Eleina.

07:48.090 --> 07:48.946
How?

07:49.136 --> 07:51.486
Satellite connection too
can not be used.

07:51.700 --> 07:54.103
The signal is indeed blocked.

07:59.229 --> 08:00.029
That's right.

08:00.480 --> 08:03.458
I want to apply for MIT research
in that era.

08:03.952 --> 08:05.782
I will try.

08:06.195 --> 08:10.011
The FBI's movements are also becoming more agile.

08:10.196 --> 08:12.097
Is this a territorial dispute?

08:12.450 --> 08:16.056
I will contact you
when you already know the situation.

08:16.205 --> 08:17.308
Understood.

08:23.826 --> 08:25.900
No incoming calls.

08:26.270 --> 08:28.110
We can only believe
and wait for them.

08:28.520 --> 08:30.376
Is it really okay?

08:30.570 --> 08:32.463
They were members of Lazarus.

08:32.857 --> 08:35.107
Don't treat them
like a child.

08:35.255 --> 08:37.045
Yes, of course!

08:38.352 --> 08:39.993
He was having fun instead.

08:40.040 --> 08:41.945
It's just a waste of energy.

08:47.388 --> 08:48.324
Hey.

08:48.433 --> 08:49.183
Yes?

08:49.428 --> 08:52.316
The woman this afternoon
your mother, right?

08:52.751 --> 08:53.831
Yes

08:54.201 --> 08:57.142
You guys seem awkward
and less familiar.

08:58.129 --> 09:00.447
In this place,
all people are family.

09:00.713 --> 09:03.775
We have to forget
blood relationship.

09:04.482 --> 09:06.456
I am also banned
call her mother.

09:06.480 --> 09:07.560
Why?

09:08.198 --> 09:10.220
What does your mother think?

09:10.867 --> 09:12.117
That person...

09:13.530 --> 09:16.595
...just thinking about God
inside his head.

09:17.015 --> 09:18.328
How is your father?

09:18.676 --> 09:21.136
I don't know who my father is.

09:22.561 --> 09:24.502
You must think I'm weird, right?

09:24.725 --> 09:28.935
But, I always think
that this is normal.

09:29.516 --> 09:32.186
Because of this place
is the center of the world.

09:33.065 --> 09:34.025
But...

09:34.735 --> 09:36.775
It's strange, isn't it?

09:38.143 --> 09:39.447
No...

09:49.006 --> 09:53.490
LAZARUS

09:55.690 --> 10:00.370
In this place, food ingredients,
clothing, and necessities of life,

10:00.431 --> 10:02.431
everything is the result of the hard work of the people here.

10:02.747 --> 10:06.098
Money can't be used here,
So barter is the solution.

10:06.992 --> 10:09.662
All this is thanks to the guide
from the Dragon Lord.

10:16.408 --> 10:18.581
What are you two doing?
do outside?

10:18.843 --> 10:21.560
Unlike this place,
the outside world needs money, right?

10:21.664 --> 10:23.417
That...

10:23.637 --> 10:24.825
Can you mention your job?
part time, really.

10:24.866 --> 10:25.817
Oh yes.

10:26.126 --> 10:27.926
What kind of job is that?

10:28.706 --> 10:31.536
I wonder how,
my part time job is looking for cats...

10:31.567 --> 10:33.376
...and met Elaina from there.

10:33.560 --> 10:36.035
Your work is hard, huh?

10:36.136 --> 10:37.822
Don't ask again.

10:38.070 --> 10:40.551
I was threatened with a gun
time to collect debts.

10:40.891 --> 10:43.111
I'm being chased by a syndicate.

10:43.545 --> 10:46.734
Asked to dress up as a girl
and in the end, he was chased again.

10:48.113 --> 10:50.551
If I remember again,

10:50.940 --> 10:53.107
My workplace is so cruel.

10:53.247 --> 10:54.826
Yes

10:59.081 --> 11:02.081
Give divine revelation
into our bodies.

11:03.054 --> 11:04.565
O Lord Dragon.

11:04.897 --> 11:06.708
Dragon Lord.

11:07.100 --> 11:08.669
Dragon Lord.

11:13.592 --> 11:15.760
Close your eyes and open your mouth.

11:18.185 --> 11:19.685
Good, swallow.

11:20.053 --> 11:21.513
That's proof that you
officially become our family.

11:26.349 --> 11:30.512
Everyone, new family members
that Eleina brought...

11:30.790 --> 11:34.620
...surely get special blessing
on the Holy Day the day after tomorrow.

11:36.955 --> 11:38.130
Speaking of Dragons.

11:38.246 --> 11:40.033
I already know his identity.

11:40.283 --> 11:41.521
What is that thing?

11:41.826 --> 11:43.505
Fifteen years ago...

11:43.614 --> 11:47.954
Imitation mind that has neural network
developed at MIT.

11:48.438 --> 11:49.786
Neural networks?

11:49.810 --> 11:53.708
Simply put, imitation reason is created
from human neural networks.

11:55.153 --> 11:56.889
A person whose brain
used as a model is...

11:56.950 --> 11:59.822
...a single genius
who came after Einstein...

11:59.916 --> 12:01.084
...Prosefor Skinner.

12:02.842 --> 12:05.472
Then, a test was run.

12:05.777 --> 12:09.447
They program ego and control
on the basis of imitation reason.

12:09.963 --> 12:11.439
Be a Dragon.

12:11.569 --> 12:12.321
Correct.

12:12.441 --> 12:14.167
It seems dangerous.

12:14.259 --> 12:15.692
Another.

12:16.153 --> 12:18.808
The FBI is also investigating the sect
gradually.

12:19.365 --> 12:22.038
Does that mean Skinner is there?

12:23.430 --> 12:26.220
I want to move faster
than the FBI, but...

12:32.297 --> 12:36.927
<i>I've looked everywhere,</i>
<i>but Skinner's presence is non-existent.</i>

12:37.591 --> 12:39.641
<i>Well then, it's time for Plan B!</i>

12:40.625 --> 12:44.275
We have to access the Dragon
and scoop out Skinner's head!

12:44.613 --> 12:46.513
In that case,
we wait until evening.

12:46.726 --> 12:47.686
Okay.

13:00.455 --> 13:02.521
Don't cut off the electricity
that flows through the Dragon.

13:02.590 --> 13:03.550
I know.

13:05.670 --> 13:06.997
Power failure?

13:30.325 --> 13:31.164
Here he is!

13:31.478 --> 13:34.453
This is the Dragon's memory area!

13:34.565 --> 13:36.234
Excellent!

13:39.720 --> 13:41.464
Dragon Lord can easily...

13:41.597 --> 13:44.717
...guessing human thoughts.

13:45.121 --> 13:46.161
Elaine.

13:51.635 --> 13:52.660
Elaine!

14:00.268 --> 14:01.242
Elaine.

14:02.118 --> 14:04.563
It seems your heart is still dirty.

14:05.395 --> 14:07.922
On the Holy Day tomorrow,

14:08.048 --> 14:13.098
you will be purified in front of the Dragon Lord
as a symbol of the filth of this world.

14:14.229 --> 14:15.099
Bingo.

14:15.345 --> 14:18.861
This is the personal data of MIT researchers
that I asked from Hersch.

14:18.932 --> 14:20.421
His name is Billy Perez.

14:20.592 --> 14:21.659
What is this?

14:21.765 --> 14:22.935
He is a representative in the communion.

14:23.128 --> 14:27.597
He brought the Dragon out
from MIT without permission...

14:27.965 --> 14:31.975
...founded this sect,
and praise the Dragon as God.

14:32.411 --> 14:36.211
Then, the communion refused all contact
from the outside world.

14:36.667 --> 14:42.591
Communion may be just a tool for
satisfying the Dragon's dominance and perspective.

14:42.742 --> 14:44.952
A playground for God, huh?

14:45.934 --> 14:50.265
Isn't it the Dragon
a copy of Skinner?

14:50.573 --> 14:51.669
That's right.

14:51.952 --> 14:56.638
If so, maybe he would like to
destroying the world like Skinner.

15:02.532 --> 15:06.292
What are Holy Days and Purification?

15:07.055 --> 15:09.921
Holy Days did not exist in my time.

15:10.462 --> 15:12.048
But, I know about purification.

15:13.203 --> 15:16.290
We will be taken to a place
and can't meet again.

15:16.631 --> 15:18.881
At first, I thought they were exiled.

15:19.417 --> 15:21.023
Perhaps...

15:21.160 --> 15:22.243
They were burned.

15:23.246 --> 15:26.496
Sinners to be burned
to purify his body.

15:26.700 --> 15:29.766
We're going to be burned alive?

15:30.022 --> 15:31.022
Yes

15:31.220 --> 15:33.765
After burning you on the Holy Day,

15:34.002 --> 15:37.566
your body must be thrown away
so as not to contaminate the world.

15:38.110 --> 15:40.495
All members of the communion are the same.

15:40.774 --> 15:41.580
Huh?

15:41.641 --> 15:42.891
Are you serious?

15:44.232 --> 15:46.968
Hannah, are you sure?
is it okay like this?

15:47.852 --> 15:49.834
Can you be happy...

15:50.096 --> 15:52.437
...after sacrificing himself
on someone's orders?

15:53.249 --> 15:54.281
Elaine.

15:55.392 --> 15:58.796
I've always been jealous of you.

16:00.009 --> 16:02.416
I always live in self-restraint.

16:03.034 --> 16:06.122
I obey the Dragon
and carry out all commands.

16:06.692 --> 16:10.327
I think it's not allowed
have your own thoughts.

16:11.602 --> 16:14.442
But, you are different.

16:15.730 --> 16:16.900
Why?

16:18.078 --> 16:20.538
You're cheating because you're free all by yourself!

16:22.590 --> 16:24.246
I think so!

16:28.805 --> 16:29.765
Hannah.

16:30.330 --> 16:31.660
Let's go together.

16:32.098 --> 16:33.468
Come with us.

16:33.874 --> 16:36.133
That is clearly impossible.

16:36.292 --> 16:38.299
This is my only place!

16:38.834 --> 16:40.688
I can't live
in the outside world!

16:41.251 --> 16:43.477
I used to think like that too.

16:44.122 --> 16:48.305
All the residents here
reject the outside world...

16:48.404 --> 16:50.074
...so stop thinking.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.380
At first, I was scared too.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.030
But...

16:55.461 --> 16:57.607
When I gather my courage
and start walking...

16:57.670 --> 16:58.897
Stop!

17:00.214 --> 17:03.265
I'm not wrong!

17:03.806 --> 17:04.880
Hannah!

17:05.515 --> 17:07.875
There is a beacon in my bag.

17:08.404 --> 17:11.729
If you have
the courage to step...

17:11.870 --> 17:13.200
...use it!

17:22.067 --> 17:25.598
Now, the Holy Day will begin.

17:27.541 --> 17:29.605
O Great Dragon!

17:29.849 --> 17:34.058
Cleanse the body and heart
these two dirty kids!

17:40.165 --> 17:42.280
Let's purify!

18:10.277 --> 18:11.107
That's the sign!

18:20.392 --> 18:21.519
What happened?

18:21.578 --> 18:23.786
Maybe Lord Dragon
was furious.

18:23.896 --> 18:25.192
Noisy.

18:26.472 --> 18:28.395
Everyone, come inside quickly!

18:37.159 --> 18:39.083
It is time
remove the forbidden seal!

18:41.932 --> 18:43.028
Come on!

18:46.495 --> 18:48.405
O my family!

18:48.944 --> 18:52.169
It's time for our souls to wander!

19:00.599 --> 19:02.464
It's the FBI! Come on, hurry up!

19:08.072 --> 19:09.184
Are you ok?

19:09.252 --> 19:10.209
Are you hurt?

19:10.472 --> 19:11.816
No.

19:11.941 --> 19:13.767
We have to help
other people.

19:13.904 --> 19:14.528
Huh?

19:14.738 --> 19:17.700
They all intend to die!

19:20.220 --> 19:21.640
Correct.

19:22.187 --> 19:24.397
Receive our souls!

19:25.832 --> 19:28.614
Right, Mr. Dragon?

19:31.421 --> 19:32.717
Dragon Lord?

19:33.190 --> 19:34.381
Lord Dragon!

19:54.486 --> 19:55.415
Hannah!

19:57.765 --> 20:00.116
Thank you, Hannah.

20:14.760 --> 20:15.748
Dragon.

20:16.486 --> 20:18.166
What do you want to do?

20:18.974 --> 20:21.753
Why did you kill instead?
your followers?

20:27.074 --> 20:31.378
I got an order
to be God.

20:31.588 --> 20:36.169
Then, the figure who can
playing with human lives...

20:36.493 --> 20:39.240
...only then can one be called God.

20:39.972 --> 20:41.280
How?

20:41.613 --> 20:44.605
Am I suitable for the role?
as God?

20:45.621 --> 20:47.411
Stupid.

20:47.815 --> 20:50.240
You're just a crazy machine.

21:00.780 --> 21:03.903
The FBI just held a
Press conference...

21:03.982 --> 21:07.112
...and all followers
has been successfully evacuated.

21:07.470 --> 21:12.246
This case concerns
imitation mind crime...

21:12.353 --> 21:15.623
...quite a lot of attention.

21:15.822 --> 21:18.058
That's all I can say from the scene.

21:18.709 --> 21:24.499
I didn't expect imitation reason
strong can cause cases like this.

21:25.751 --> 21:26.623
How?

21:27.243 --> 21:29.152
This is Dragon's memory.

21:29.786 --> 21:32.334
I don't know how much data
that can be saved.

21:37.263 --> 21:38.653
Enter!

21:42.125 --> 21:43.107
What is it?

21:43.620 --> 21:45.120
Can I sleep here?

21:45.521 --> 21:46.759
Sure it is allowed.

22:11.982 --> 22:15.487
DATA ANALYSIS
GETTING STARTED ANALYZING DATA

22:15.520 --> 22:18.770
17 DAYS LEFT

23:50.054 --> 23:54.937
NEXT EPISODE
#7: ALMOST BLUE
